The text of the acts in this repository is not protected by copyright. Section 5 of the Slovak Copyright Act (zákon
č. 185/2015 Z. z. Autorský zákon), in the version in force from 1 September 2026 as published in Slov-Lex, reads:

    Za predmet autorského práva sa nepovažuje
    [...]
    b) text právneho predpisu, úradné rozhodnutie alebo súdne rozhodnutie, technická norma,2) ako aj spolu s nimi
    vytvorená prípravná dokumentácia a ich preklad, bez ohľadu na to, či spĺňajú podmienky podľa § 3 ods. 1,

("The following is not a subject of copyright: [...] b) the text of a legal regulation, an official decision or a
court decision, a technical standard, and the preparatory documentation created with them and their translation,
whether or not they meet the conditions of § 3(1).")

Source of the text: Slov-Lex, the legal and information portal of the Slovak Republic (www.slov-lex.sk and its static
mirror static.slov-lex.sk), operated by the Ministerstvo spravodlivosti Slovenskej republiky (Ministry of Justice of
the Slovak Republic), Račianska 71, 813 11 Bratislava. Each version page states: "Obsah zobrazeného právneho predpisu má
informatívny charakter, právne záväzný obsah sa nachádza v pdf verzii právneho predpisu." ("The content of the
displayed legal regulation is for information; the legally binding content is in the PDF version of the legal
regulation.") Only the Collection of Laws of the Slovak Republic (Zbierka zákonov) is authoritative.

Everything else in this repository (the history as commits, the commit messages, the tables and the tools) is
dedicated to the public domain under CC0 1.0 Universal:
https://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/legalcode

